Malaga Event Gear provides audio visual rental for seminars in Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol: a laser projector and screen, PA sound, and a microphone sized to your seminar's format. Backed by experience going back to 1996, our crew delivers, installs and tests the projector, screen and microphone before your first attendee arrives, whether you are speaking solo or running a lectern-style session.

