## FAQs

### What AV equipment do I need for a seminar?

A laser projector and screen for slides, PA sound, and a microphone for the presenter. The [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) and [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) cover these needs at different scales. See [Match Your Seminar to a Package](#match-your-seminar-to-a-package) above.

### How much does audio visual rental cost for a seminar?

Pricing depends on the package: our full catalog, from the Basic MICE Pack up to the Product Presentation Pack, is listed with exact euro pricing on our [packages page](/packages/). All rates are ex VAT, with 21 percent Spanish VAT added at checkout, and every price includes delivery, setup and teardown.

### What is the difference between AV for a small seminar and a larger one?

A single presenter with a wireless mic fits the [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/). A lectern-style seminar or workshop up to 40 guests fits the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/), which uses a gooseneck podium microphone instead.

### What microphone is best for a seminar speaker?

A wireless handheld microphone, included on the [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/), suits a presenter who moves around. A gooseneck microphone, included on the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/), suits a lectern or podium format.

### Do I need a technician for a seminar AV setup?

Not on the Product Presentation Pack: the equipment is delivered, installed and tested by our crew, then run by you. On the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/), a technician is available as an add on.

### Can I connect my own laptop to the projector?

Yes. The [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) includes HDMI and USB-C adapters plus audio interfaces to connect your laptop, tablet or media player.

### How many people can attend a seminar with a standard AV setup?

The [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) covers up to 40 guests. For a larger seminar, see our [audio visual rental for conferences](/blog/audio-visual-rental-for-conferences/) guide.

### How far in advance should I book AV equipment for a seminar?

Book at least 24 hours in advance to guarantee availability. Our services are available in Malaga and extend to Granada for rentals over 400 euros.
